WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.468
It was the day of tryouts.

2
00:00:05.469 --> 00:00:13.881
Eddy saw Zippy.

3
00:00:13.882 --> 00:00:22.963
He saw other cars too.

4
00:00:22.964 --> 00:00:32.433
They all looked pretty fast.

5
00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:36.500
"Welcome to tryouts," said Mr. Grill.

6
00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:41.846
"I need four fast racers."

7
00:00:41.847 --> 00:00:45.503
"How will you pick them?" Zippy asked.

8
00:00:45.504 --> 00:00:48.933
"We'll have a race," said Mr. Grill.

9
00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:53.180
"I'll pick the four winners."

10
00:00:53.181 --> 00:00:56.920
"Me!" said Zippy.

11
00:00:56.921 --> 00:01:00.085
"Maybe," said Mr. Grill.

12
00:01:00.086 --> 00:01:05.280
"Everyone, line up."

13
00:01:05.281 --> 00:01:10.081
Eddy went to the starting line.

14
00:01:10.082 --> 00:01:14.091
He was between two big cars.

15
00:01:14.092 --> 00:01:17.753
Their engines rumbled.

16
00:01:17.754 --> 00:01:21.054
Eddy gulped.

17
00:01:21.055 --> 00:01:25.417
But then he heard his friends.

18
00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:31.968
"You can do it, Eddy!" Poppy shouted.

19
00:01:31.969 --> 00:01:36.050
"Good luck, everyone," said Mr. Grill.

20
00:01:36.051 --> 00:01:40.266
"Ready, set . . . go!"

21
00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:44.459
Eddy took off.

22
00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:47.552
"I can do this," he thought.

23
00:01:47.553 --> 00:01:53.701
"I can make the team!"

